  from near the edge is the most valuable observation of all.\nClosest appr
 oach 00:45:03 IST\, give or take 2 s. The star is 15° up in the NE · dar
 k sky.\nIt fades 3.3 magnitudes for up to 1.1 s on the centre line\, and t
 he path is 18 km wide\, give or take 13 km.\nFinder chart\, the map and th
 e path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroids-2026-09#2026-09-12-1246-
